<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Jordi Serrano — Desarrollador Full Stack</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #070b14;
      --surface: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --text: #e8eaf0;
      --muted: #7a8099;
      --accent: #7c6dfa;
      --accent2: #f06a6a;
      --accent3: #4fd1c5;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Canvas fixed background */
    #bg-canvas {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Layout */
    .page {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-inner { max-width: 700px; }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,109,250,0.3);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }

    .hero-contacts {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .chip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--text); }
    .chip svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }

    .scroll-hint {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 2rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }
    .scroll-hint svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px); }
    }

    /* Sections */
    .section {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }
    .section.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    /* Cards */
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 3px; height: 100%;
      background: var(--accent);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .card:hover { border-color: rgba(124,109,250,0.25); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
    .card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .card-company {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .card-role {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .card-date {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .card ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .card ul li {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      padding: 2px 0 2px 1rem;
      position: relative;
    }
    .card ul li::before {
      content: '→';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--accent3);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    /* Skills grid */
    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .skill-group {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .skill-group:hover { border-color: rgba(124,109,250,0.3); }

    .skill-group-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent3);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    .skill-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 3px 9px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* AI extra */
    .ai-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,109,250,0.08), rgba(79,209,197,0.05));
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,109,250,0.2);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.8rem;
    }
    .ai-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

    /* Education */
    .edu-card { display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; align-items: flex-start; }
    .edu-dot {
      width: 10px; height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* Languages */
    .lang-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .lang-chip {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* Divider */
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="bg-canvas"></canvas>

<div class="page">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-tag">Disponible para nuevos proyectos</div>
      <h1>Jordi <span>Serrano</span></h1>
      <p>Desarrollador Web Full Stack con experiencia en Inteligencia Artificial, especializado en soluciones digitales eficientes combinando Backend, Frontend y automatización.</p>
      <div class="hero-contacts">
        <a class="chip" href="mailto:jordiscdot@gmail.com">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 7 10-7"/></svg>
          jordiscdot@gmail.com
        </a>
        <a class="chip" href="tel:627924258">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2A19.79 19.79 0 0 1 11.61 19a19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.79 19.79 0 0 1 3.09 4.22 2 2 0 0 1 5.07 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L9.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
          627 924 258
        </a>
        <span class="chip">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
          Girona, España
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-hint">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/></svg>
      scroll
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="section" id="exp">
    <div class="section-label">Trayectoria</div>
    <div class="section-title">Experiencia Laboral</div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div>
          <div class="card-company">Fustes Esteba</div>
          <div class="card-role">Programador ABAP · Girona</div>
        </div>
        <span class="card-date">Oct 2025 — Presente</span>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Desarrollo y mantenimiento de programas ABAP en SAP ECC 6.0 (SAP_BASIS 731)</li>
        <li>Participación activa en migración de SAP R/3 v731 a S/4HANA</li>
        <li>Análisis de impacto, adaptación de desarrollos Z y validación post-migración</li>
        <li>Consultoría SAP y atención a usuarios finales</li>
